SUNO YE AWAAZ WA HUSSAINA KI ZARRE ZARRE SE AARAHI HAIN<br>
 HAR EK LAMHA KHUDAYI SAARI HUSSAIN KA GHAM MANA RAHI HAIN<br>
<br>
SADA-E-AKBAR PA SUE MAQTAL,HUSSAIN TEZI SE JARAHE HAIN ,<br>
 MAGAR ZAEEFI KHADAM KHADAM PAR GIRA RAHI HAIN UTHA RAHI HAIN<br>
<br>
ALAM KE HAIN SATH SATH HAR DAM TOH AISA MEHSOOS HORAHA HAI,<br>
 KE AB BHI MAZLOOMIYAT PA GAZI KI MASHQ AANSOU BAHA RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
HUSSAIN &ndash;E-BEKAS KE SATH AKBAR HAIN AUR ABBAS-E- BAWAFA HAIN,<br>
 ABA MEIN DULHE KI LAASH LEKAR BARAAT MAQTAL SE AARAHI HAI<br>
<br>
QABAR KISI QAFELE KI AANE KI JAB KABHI BHI WATAN MEIN AATI,<br>
 GAREEB SUGHRA YEHI SAMAJTI SAWARI BABA KI AARAHI HAIN<br>
<br>
HAI KARBALA MEINYE KOUNBACCHAKEJIS PA TEERE SITAM CHALA HAI,<br>
 WATAN MEIN SUGHRA YE KISKI YAADO MEIN KHALI JHOOLA JHOOLA RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
 RABAB KE CHHE(6) MAHINE WALE KA MAREKA HAIN AJEEB DEKHO,<br>
 KE ZULM AANSOU BAHA RAHA HAI TOH TISHNAGI MUSKURA RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
PUKARI ZAINAB TADAP TADAP KAR KAHA HO ABBAS AAKE DEKHO,<br>
 QADAM QADAM PAR MERI SAKINA TAMACHE ZALIM KE KHA RAHI HAI<br>
<br>
RASAN MEIN JAKDE HAIN SAB KE SHAANE SAKINA TERA GALA BANDHA HAI,<br>
 JO HAIN AZIYAT KAHO GI KAISE KE SAANS RUK RUK KE AARAHI HAI<br>
<br>
NAHI HAI ZAINAB KE SAR PA CHADAR RASAN MEIN BAZOO BANDHE HUE HAIN,<br>
 ALI KI BETI KA HAI YE AALAM JO AAJ DARBAR JARAHI HAI